      "nuance_tags": ["emphasis"],
      "usage_contexts": ["spoken", "written", "announcement"],
      "steps_unavailable": "Two-slot frame, not a single derivation. The record's formation is Noun1 + はもちろん + Noun2 + も, so it binds two independent noun slots, and the point exists precisely because of the second one (the も element that widens the scope). A linear step list transforms exactly one base and appends fixed literal tokens, so the only sequence available here — [noun, append はもちろん] — would emit 数学はもちろん and silently drop the Noun2 + も half, licensing an incomplete surface.",
